From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 23:30:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 68/69] POC-18i: self-tests give up after 3 minutes (battles
 are slower)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
---
 src/pkbn/selftest.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/pkbn/selftest.c b/src/pkbn/selftest.c
index c58222f..b0b099c 100644
--- a/src/pkbn/selftest.c
+++ b/src/pkbn/selftest.c
@@ -347,7 +347,7 @@ static void CB2_SelfTestBattle(void)
     {
         struct PkbnGridDebug d;
         PkbnGrid_GetDebug(&d);
-        if (d.frame > 60 * 120) // 2 minutes: give up
+        if (d.frame > 60 * 180) // 3 minutes: give up (POC-18: battles are about 25% slower)
         {
             printf("[pkbn-selftest] TIMEOUT\n");
             exit(2);
